ROCCA DI FRONTIERA
Coarse plan, 1 cell = 4 voxels.
  x  courtyard: a rectangle with random sides around N.
  W  wall ring, 3 cells thick, 9 layers high (36 voxels). O is its outer face, with merlons.
  t  four corner towers, solid to 52 voxels.
  c  the ring corner inside each tower: a platform at walk level.
  G  gate on the front axis, 3 wide, in the outer face, with a dark wood lintel.
     The road v runs straight to the edge.
  h  gatehouse (corpo di guardia): a covered hall 7x4 behind the gate, built into the
     two inner wall rows and two courtyard rows. Its stone roof S is part of the wall walk.
     l are its walls. H is its back door, 3 wide, to the courtyard.
  k  keep, in the back corner farthest from the gate, 9x6.
       r  its two rooms, each 7x4: the ground room and the upper hall at walk level.
       d  ground door to the courtyard.  o  upper door onto the wall walk.
  p  armoury, in the other back corner. y its one-storey room, D its door.
     Some seeds give it a second storey: Y room, J tall walls, Z tall door,
     Q upper door onto the wall walk.
  i/j  stair strip, 3x5, climbing to the wall walk against a side wall.
  w/q  the well and two troughs: the jumps.
  f  free cells around doors and buildings.
-->
